==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 5.33~20 seconds<sup>160f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~30.67 seconds<sup>400f~920f</sup>.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Ideally, one would use long-ranged cats to chip away at Master A. and his support. However, due to Master A.'s high range, very few cats can safely hit him. [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|Rushers]] like [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Cat Gang]] can sneak in to deal quick damage to support enemies and Master A. Use any tanky units, such as [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] to lock Master A. in place and deal damage, though they may be killed quickly by the Celeboodles. Alternatively, one can use [[Long Distance]] units that can hit Master A. past the peons in the front.

